4
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:14,440
Look, it's burning. Akaneru will
work out somehow eventually too.

5
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:23,720
You understand, right? I get it, I get it.
Once you do, gather up and follow me.

6
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:51,160
Life on Earth was on the brink of
extinction from a bacterial attack by humans.

7
00:01:56,100 --> 00:02:00,640
That day, at the secret base of
the Earth Defense Division, humanity

8
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:08,220
No, the 14th meeting was about to convene
to decide the fate of all life on Earth.

9
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:16,400
Aaaaaaah!

10
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,560
Aaaaaaah!

11
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,300
Aaaaaaah!

12
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:45,680
The reason I've gathered you all
here today is none other than this:

13
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:53,960
