against Shabadobi 11PM.

14
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:54,880
Really!?

15
00:02:54,940 --> 00:02:55,780
Is that so!?

16
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:57,120
Is that so!?

17
00:02:57,320 --> 00:03:00,220
Dr. Iidabashi, please explain.

18
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:07,560
Hello, everyone.
I'm Iidabashi of the Paradise Laboratory.

19
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:15,240
I thoroughly searched for an antibody that could counter Shabadobi 11PM,
including past databases.

20
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:20,820
As a result, I was able to discover
just one antibody with that potential.

21
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:23,140
Please look at the screen.

22
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:30,800
This antibody was extracted from the lymphocytes
of a police officer in Japan 300 years ago.

23
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:36,660
Amazingly, this was an invincible
antibody that repels every kind of virus.

24
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:43,480
However, its potency was so intense back then that it was
deemed dangerous to administer to anyone but the original host.

25
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:51,980
But now it's the 24th century.

26
00:03:51,980 --> 00:03:57,020
With modern medicine,
it's possible to control this antibody.

27
00:03:57,020 --> 00:03:58,740
What? Is that true?

28
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:04,760
And here are the simulation
results against Shabadobi 11PM.

29
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:10,860
If we can obtain this antibody
and mass-produce a vaccine,

30
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:15,960
we can eliminate the threat of the
Dobidaba aliens' bacterial attacks.

31
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:23,120
Doctor

32
