The name of this shining hope
that will save humanity is

34
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:31,860
Ryotsu GPX.

35
00:04:31,860 --> 00:04:35,700
And the only person who
carries that antibody is

36
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:38,880
