37
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:40,960
Ryotsu!

38
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,240
Ryotsu!

39
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,360
Ryotsu!

40
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,480
Ryotsu!

41
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,460
Ryotsu!

42
00:04:45,460 --> 00:04:46,620
Ryotsu!

43
