Come in.

86
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:55,740
Excuse me. Thank you for your hard work. I never expected a
descendant of Kankichi Ryotsu to be serving in our Defense Force.

87
00:07:56,180 --> 00:08:05,000
I'm honored, sir. As the great-great-great-great-great-grandson of Kankichi Ryotsu's younger brother,
you are the perfect candidate.

88
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:07,359
Officer Ryotsu, your mission is to

89
00:08:07,409 --> 00:08:09,890
