92
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:19,280
Listen, the fate of humanity rests on your shoulders.
Good luck!

93
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:23,800
Yes, sir! I'll bring back the Ryotsu GPX,
even if it costs me my life!

94
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:36,720
And this is the man, Kankichi Ryotsu.
Well done, Terminator-chan.

95
00:08:40,420 --> 00:08:49,040
Listen, eliminate Kankichi Ryotsu before
the Earth Defense Force makes contact.

96
