185
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:06,020
Aren't you Kankichi Ryotsu?

186
00:14:06,020 --> 00:14:10,920
Kankichi is the older brother of my
great-great-great-great-great-great-great grandfather.

187
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:12,020
Aren't you Ryo-chan?

188
00:14:12,940 --> 00:14:20,400
Stop it, senior. Well, if we kill you too, there'll
be no one left to take Ryotsu to the 24th century.

189
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:22,220
...

190
00:14:22,220 --> 00:14:23,760
Aaaaaah!

191
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:40,820
Aaaaaah!

192
00:14:40,820 --> 00:14:41,500
Aaaaaah!

193
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,080
He's gone.

194
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:53,580
He sure is quick to run away.

195
00:14:55,460 --> 00:14:59,780
