205
00:15:36,820 --> 00:15:40,340
Is that really what Earth
is like 300 years from now?

206
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:43,240
I know it's hard to believe,
but it's the truth.

207
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:48,220
I always thought an alien invasion of
Earth was just something from comic books.

208
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:52,220
Terminator-chan, though.
That's a pretty obvious name.

209
00:15:52,220 --> 00:15:55,240
It's the Dobidaba aliens' sense of style,
after all.

210
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:59,200
Either way, it's certain that
Ryo-chan's life is being targeted.

211
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:01,080
I'll contact the senior officer.

212
