214
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:12,720
I know that.

215
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,260
We came all this way for a fun trip.

216
00:16:15,260 --> 00:16:16,980
It'd be a real pain if we got interrupted.

217
00:16:22,140 --> 00:16:23,600
It's no use, they won't pick up.

218
00:16:23,980 --> 00:16:26,840
