Ryo-chan and the Chief are in danger.

219
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:28,880
Let's go to Kyoto too.

220
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:29,440
Yeah.

221
00:16:32,740 --> 00:16:35,580
Then let's head straight to
the inn and drink like crazy.

222
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:38,560
