228
00:16:48,860 --> 00:16:52,180
Pay your respects and purify
that filthy heart of yours.

229
00:16:52,180 --> 00:16:53,140
Cleanse it.

230
00:17:04,700 --> 00:17:06,740
Chief, let's take a photo here.

231
00:17:06,740 --> 00:17:08,880
On the self-timer, the two of us together.

232
00:17:11,060 --> 00:17:12,680
Chief, a little more to the right.

233
00:17:13,840 --> 00:17:14,820
Like this?

234
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,780
