235
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:22,040
Ukitsu Yoshizuka,
100% chance it's him in person.

236
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:30,000
Okay, here we go.

237
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:32,880
Target locked.

238
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:35,400
Here goes... never mind, never mind.

239
00:17:37,780 --> 00:17:39,560
What are you doing?

240
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:43,360
Slipping at Moss Temple, get it?
"Koke," like falling, ha

241
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:48,520
Who wears such slippery
shoes on a trip anyway?

242
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:51,580
Enough. Next, we're going to Kiyomizu-dera.

243
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:57,280
Hey, Chief, the photo's not done yet!
Wait, Chief!

244
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:01,560
Right, Kokedera, ha Kokedera.

245
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:04,120
Keep at it forever, Chief.

246
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:10,940
Say cheese!

247
00:18:10,940 --> 00:18:14,140
Alright, let's go to Ryoanji next!

248
00:18:14,140 --> 00:18:16,200
Wait a second, Chief.

249
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:19,780
I haven't had a single picture taken yet!

250
00:18:19,780 --> 00:18:21,980
It's a waste of film.

251
00:18:21,980 --> 00:18:24,300
Chief, that's a bit harsh.

252
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:27,480
Don't they say travel is better with
companions and life is better with kindness?

253
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:29,920
Fine, just one picture.

254
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:30,900
Please.

255
00:18:30,900 --> 00:18:34,540
Please. Chief, make me look cool in it.

256
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:45,212
Okay,

257
00:18:45,262 --> 00:18:48,760
cheese.

258
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:23,540
Th-there he is!

259
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:29,280
Is this what Kyoto looks
like in the 21st century?

260
00:19:29,860 --> 00:19:31,580
So what do we do, Kei-chan?

261
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:35,200
The two of them must
be sightseeing in Kyoto.

262
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:39,100
Even so, there are far too
many famous sights in Kyoto.

263
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:42,420
If we don't find them soon,
Senpai's life is in danger.

264
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:06,680
Chief, why do I have to sit in zazen too?

265
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:09,920
It's to purify your filthy, corrupted heart.

266
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:11,020
I'm being quiet, aren't I.

267
00:20:11,560 --> 00:20:13,320
That's none of your business.

268
00:20:14,860 --> 00:20:15,580
Here we go again.

269
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:25,260
It's a mole!

270
00:20:27,860 --> 00:20:28,860
It's huge!

271
00:20:29,300 --> 00:20:30,220
Alright, just a little peek in!

272
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:31,820
Yaaah!

273
00:20:31,880 --> 00:20:32,660
Hey, Ryusu!

274
00:20:35,980 --> 00:20:37,720
There you are, you monster mole!

275
00:20:38,100 --> 00:20:38,600
Come on!

276
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:40,120
I won't let you get away!

277
00:20:40,620 --> 00:20:42,740
Come on, come on, come on, come on,
come on, come on, come on, come on!

278
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:44,460
Kunya! Kunya! Kunya!

279
00:20:44,460 --> 00:20:46,080
Kurya! Kurya! Kurya!

280
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:47,900
Kunya! Kunya! Kunya! Kunya!

281
00:20:47,900 --> 00:20:49,900
Hey, come over here!

282
00:20:50,060 --> 00:20:51,500
Nyaa!

283
00:20:51,520 --> 00:20:52,440
Ow ow!

284
00:20:52,620 --> 00:20:54,960
Damn it, that mole is fast!

285
00:20:55,360 --> 00:20:56,300
You idiot!

286
00:20:56,300 --> 00:21:00,220
Yeah! What have you done to a
national heritage stone monument?!

287
00:21:08,460 --> 00:21:09,980
I'm definitely going to kill you!

288
00:21:12,320 --> 00:21:16,297
Nothing beats a hot spring trip.
But, Ryotsu,

289
00:21:16,347 --> 00:21:19,500
whenever I travel with you,
nothing good ever happens.

290
00:21:19,700 --> 00:21:23,400
Yeah, yeah,
that's the 65th time you've told that story.

291
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:29,300
I'm the one who has to keep
bowing my head to everyone,

292
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:31,840
Yeah, yeah, I know.

293
00:21:31,840 --> 00:21:36,900
Ryotsu,
do you even know how much I suffer for you?

294
00:21:36,900 --> 00:21:38,920
I told you, I do know.

295
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:42,140
Whenever I travel with you,
nothing good happens.

296
00:21:42,140 --> 00:21:43,140
Yeah, yeah.

297
00:21:43,140 --> 00:21:46,380
I'm the one who has to keep
bowing my head to everyone too.

298
00:21:46,380 --> 00:21:48,000
That's the 66th time already.

299
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:48,960
Did you say something?

300
00:21:48,960 --> 00:21:52,960
No, no, no, really,
I can't beat Chief Ohara.

301
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:56,100
Finally got it, you idiot.

302
00:21:56,180 --> 00:21:58,360
I can't win against Chief Ohara.

303
00:22:01,260 --> 00:22:03,280
Chief, I'm going back to my room too.

304
00:22:03,540 --> 00:22:03,960
I see.

305
00:22:04,760 --> 00:22:06,820
If she's pretty,
she's got a surprisingly big bust

306
00:22:07,180 --> 00:22:08,640
Are you the type who gets cold easily?

307
00:22:08,940 --> 00:22:10,940
Ugh, these fingers of mine, honestly...

308
00:22:13,420 --> 00:22:14,040
Ryotsu.

309
00:22:14,540 --> 00:22:14,900
Okay.

310
00:22:16,860 --> 00:22:17,800
H-hey! Hey!

311
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:19,160
A police officer like you,

312
00:22:19,180 --> 00:22:21,940
do you really think it's okay
to do such shameless things?!

313
00:22:22,020 --> 00:22:23,100
Chief, please stop!

314
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:25,320
I'm almost able to see!

315
00:22:26,360 --> 00:22:29,160
That's enough already!

316
00:22:41,180 --> 00:22:42,520
Pardon us!

317
00:22:58,700 --> 00:23:01,500
I'll definitely kill Kankichi Ryotsu!

318
00:23:04,880 --> 00:23:08,380
Thanks to you,
I was almost mistaken for a molester!

319
00:23:08,380 --> 00:23:10,740
Because the Chief went
and kicked Oki around!

320
00:23:10,740 --> 00:23:12,300
Chief, Ryo-chan!

321
00:23:12,300 --> 00:23:15,360
W-why are you guys here?

322
00:23:15,360 --> 00:23:17,700
Ryo-san, you're safe, then?

323
00:23:18,940 --> 00:23:21,380
What are you all doing here?

324
00:23:21,380 --> 00:23:23,160
Well, actually...

325
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:24,500
What?

326
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:32,220
W-why are there two of me?

